Source: wb-node-red
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Wiren Board Team <info@wirenboard.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: wb-node-red
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, docker-ce, wb-docker-app
Description: Node-RED service for Wiren Board controllers
 Installs Node-RED as a docker-compose service managed by wb-docker-app.
 Ships the package-owned base docker-compose.yml (with the wb.* labels) to
 /usr/lib/wb-docker-app/node-red/. The thin maintainer scripts call into the
 shared helper: postinst runs "wb-docker-app install node-red" (which seeds the
 user layer under /mnt/data/wb-docker-apps/node-red/, pulls the image, brings
 the container up and enables it under the templated systemd unit) and prerm
 runs "wb-docker-app remove node-red".
